    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186133831,
      "id": "e34a2cbf-0bed-50eb-9e62-7c6e55560cb9",
      "title": "Constructing Line Integrals of a Vector-Valued Functions Over Plane Curves"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "cff3abf4-bf4f-5135-9cab-adeca0cb774c",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Which ordinary definite integral represents $\\int_C \\mathbf{F}\\cdot\\mathrm{d}\\mathbf{r}$ given that $\\mathbf{F}(x,y)=(y^{2})\\,\\mathbf{i}+(- 2 x^{2})\\,\\mathbf{j}$ and $C$ is the path $\\mathbf{r}(t)=(t^{2})\\,\\mathbf{i}+(t^{3})\\,\\mathbf{j}$ for $t\\in [0,1]$?\n\nUse the supplied parameterization and limits. Select the integral whose integrand is $\\mathbf{F}(\\mathbf{r}(t))\\cdot \\mathbf{r}^{\\prime}(t)$; do not evaluate it.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the vector line-integral formula:\n\n$$\n\\int_C \\mathbf{F}\\cdot\\mathrm{d}\\mathbf{r}=\\int_a^b \\mathbf{F}(\\mathbf{r}(t))\\cdot \\mathbf{r}^{\\prime}(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t.\n$$\n\nSubstitute the coordinates $x=t^{2}$ and $y=t^{3}$ into both field components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{F}(\\mathbf{r}(t))&=((t^{3})^{2})\\,\\mathbf{i}\\\\&\\quad+(- 2 (t^{2})^{2})\\,\\mathbf{j}\\\\&=(t^{6})\\,\\mathbf{i}\\\\&\\quad+(- 2 t^{4})\\,\\mathbf{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDifferentiate each path component:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x^{\\prime}(t)&=\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}(t^{2})=2 t,\\\\y^{\\prime}(t)&=\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}(t^{3})=3 t^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiply matching components and add:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\mathbf{F}(\\mathbf{r}(t))\\cdot \\mathbf{r}^{\\prime}(t)\\\\&=(t^{6})(2 t)\\\\&\\quad+(- 2 t^{4})(3 t^{2}).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSimplify the products:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{F}(\\mathbf{r}(t))\\cdot \\mathbf{r}^{\\prime}(t)=2 t^{7} - 6 t^{6}.\n$$\n\nKeep the supplied parameter limits. The required integral is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{1}\\bigl[(t^{6})(2 t)\\\\&\\quad+(- 2 t^{4})(3 t^{2})\\bigr]\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "532e9751-17f9-5a21-8bfc-c31d4429944f",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
